f"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years. In 2025, on the middle of the grids, September to October came in at 55% of normal and November to December at 70%. Grid 15437 had its driest year in 2005 at 48% of normal.</p>"}
